            "summary": "I don't think things need an end to be good, to matter. I think we fool and trick ourselves into believing that living forever would be somehow bad, simply because we, transhumanisms aside, won't…",
            "html": "<article id=\"post-27332\" class=\"post-27332 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-citacoes category-english tag-death tag-dying tag-lie tag-life\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#citacoes\" rel=\"category\">Citações</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#english\" rel=\"category\">English</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-like-little-kids-we-lie.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">like little kids, we lie</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-like-little-kids-we-lie.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2020-06-30T22:35:23-03:00\">30/06/2020</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-like-little-kids-we-lie.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#death\" rel=\"tag\">Death</a> <a href=\"tag.html#dying\" rel=\"tag\">Dying</a> <a href=\"tag.html#lie\" rel=\"tag\">Lie</a> <a href=\"tag.html#life\" rel=\"tag\">Life</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<blockquote>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"2018-08-23-a-ilusao-da-importancia-do-sofrimento.html\">I don&#8217;t think things need an end to be good, to matter. I think we fool and trick ourselves into believing that living forever would be somehow bad, simply because we, transhumanisms aside, won&#8217;t have this. So, like a little kid that didn&#8217;t get the toy he wanted, we say we didn&#8217;t want it anyway. Because it hurts less this way.</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Me.</p>\n</div></article>",
