            "summary": "“What makes items rare is that they weren't often recognized as being interesting and all the other copies were removed. What makes finding something rare so special is the beautiful coincidence of something precious…",
            "html": "<article id=\"post-27362\" class=\"post-27362 post type-post status-publish format-quote hentry post_format-post-format-quote category-autoria-de-outros category-citacoes category-english category-filosofia tag-archive tag-jason-scott tag-rare\"><header class=\"entry-header\"><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"cat-links\"><a href=\"cat.html#autoria-de-outros\" rel=\"category\">Autoria de Outros</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#citacoes\" rel=\"category\">Citações</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#english\" rel=\"category\">English</a>, <a href=\"cat.html#filosofia\" rel=\"category\">Filosofia</a></span></div><h1 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-what-makes-items-rare.html\" rel=\"bookmark\">What makes items rare…</a></h1><div class=\"entry-meta\"><span class=\"post-format\"><a class=\"entry-format\" href=\"type.html#quote\">Citação</a></span> <span class=\"entry-date\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-what-makes-items-rare.html\" rel=\"bookmark\"><time class=\"entry-date\" datetime=\"2020-06-30T01:40:51-03:00\">30/06/2020</time></a></span> <span class=\"byline\"><span class=\"author vcard\"><a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/\" rel=\"author\">estranhosidade</a></span></span> <span class=\"comments-link\"><a href=\"2020-06-30-what-makes-items-rare.html#respond\">Deixe um comentário</a></span></div><div class=\"entry-meta tag-links-top\"><span class=\"tag-links\"><a href=\"tag.html#archive\" rel=\"tag\">Archive</a> <a href=\"tag.html#jason-scott\" rel=\"tag\">Jason Scott</a> <a href=\"tag.html#rare\" rel=\"tag\">Rare</a> </span><span class=\"tag-ellipsis\" style=\"display: none;\">...</span></div></header><!-- .entry-header --><div class=\"entry-content\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>“What makes items rare is that they weren&#8217;t often recognized as being interesting and all the other copies were removed. What makes finding something rare so special is the beautiful coincidence of something precious meeting the person who recognizes it as such.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/3em2jvT-ICU?t=69\">Jason Scott (The RTTY Art Episode) </a></p>\n</div></article>",
